[00:14.78]1. Something precious to Jehovah,
[00:19.78]Bringing him such keen delight,
[00:24.78]Is his Kingdom by Christ Jesus,
[00:27.78]Which will set all matters right.
[00:30.78](Chorus)
[00:34.56]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[00:39.24]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[00:43.66]Sing his praise among the nations,
[00:48.26]Serving him in faithfulness.
[01:04.99]2. Why be anxious for tomorrow,
[01:13.05]‘Will we hunger, will we thirst?’
[01:15.45]For our God will make provision
[01:17.85]If we seek his Kingdom first.
[01:20.25](Chorus)
[01:22.65]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[01:27.74]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[01:32.25]Sing his praise among the nations,
[01:36.75]Serving him in faithfulness.
[01:55.48]3. So declare the Kingdom good news;
[01:59.96]Help deserving ones to see
[02:04.56]That their hope is in Jehovah
[02:09.16]And in his Theocracy.
[02:16.41](Chorus)
[02:19.99]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[02:23.57]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[02:27.15]Sing his praise among the nations,
[02:34.06]Serving him in faithfulness.